	(text "12 V IN (9-24 V): reverse-polarity diode D1, TVS D2, then the TPS54202 buck set to 5.3 V; D3 drops it to ~5.0 V on the +5V rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1b1f2ca4-c769-4fa4-9f07-86de987c071f")
	)
	(text "USB-C: flashing and the serial console (native USB on GPIO19/20), and 5 V for desk use. F1 + D4 feed the +5V rail; CC pull-downs ask for 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "16003d2d-7eaa-427f-8f5e-1d829769a8ad")
	)
	(text "+5V -> 3.3 V: AP7361C (1 A LDO) for the ESP32-S3 (WiFi peaks ~350 mA), the RTC and the 3.3 V sensor supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170.18 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f3e6d71a-155c-433f-b58b-156de1f09d1e")
	)
	(text "MCU: ESP32-S3-MINI-1-N8 (no PSRAM, so GPIO35-37 stay free). Pins per hardware/pinmap.json, board 'mini'."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ccd4dac8-d03a-45e4-a27f-07bb21c81e7a")
	)
	(text "Internal I2C (GPIO12/13): DS3231MZ RTC at 0x68 + CR2032 (back side). INT/SQW on GPIO16 can wake the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0bd42824-9d90-487c-88f3-78086e625439")
	)
	(text "Sensor ports S1-S4 (JST-XH 4-pin: 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 5V, 4 SIG). SIG: 470R series + BAT54S clamps, so a 5 V digital signal is safe."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8baa3ab4-2de0-4bfe-b5e3-332c636aa80d")
	)
	(text "Both port supplies are fused (F2, F3). Pull-ups a block needs (DS18B20 4.7k, DHT22 10k) live on the block or its adapter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 224.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fe860da1-c28e-4179-bcc1-3853bb961952")
	)
	(text "I2C-1 student port, Grove pinout (1 SCL, 2 SDA, 3 3V3, 4 GND), on its own bus (GPIO14/15)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9a22b6ed-0fcf-4267-ad94-3b280cb07e02")
	)
	(text "Relays OUT1/OUT2 (GPIO35/36): Hongfa HF46F-005 (1 Form A, 5 A, 40 mA coil), low-side AO3400A, flyback diode, coil LED (shows through the lid)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.18 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "27da1a93-1698-401a-ae3d-8da3bf51beaf")
	)
	(text "Terminals: 1 COM, 2 NO. Silkscreen: LOW VOLTAGE ONLY (switch a contactor coil, not a pump)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.18 85.09 0)
		(effects
